From 872700d92285f82ed66ac26cb97624b61390a35b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:26:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enable CONFIG_BLK_DEV_UBLK for linux-intel-lts2025 kernel

- update_engine's libsnapshot uses the ublk-backed dm-user path for
  Virtual A/B Compression (VABC) snapshot merging on kernels that
  support io_uring, complementing the dm-user-only merge path used
  on older AOSP branches (e.g. A16).
- Enables OTA updates to complete snapshot merge successfully.
- Also enable CONFIG_BLKDEV_UBLK_LEGACY_OPCODES, the dependent
  symbol required by CONFIG_BLK_DEV_UBLK, to keep the defconfig
  clean under olddefconfig/diffconfig.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1660
Signed-off-by: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
---
 .../gmin64/config-lts/linux-intel-lts2025/x86_64_defconfig     | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/groups/kernel/gmin64/config-lts/linux-intel-lts2025/x86_64_defconfig b/groups/kernel/gmin64/config-lts/linux-intel-lts2025/x86_64_defconfig
index 21eff3c8..7419e292 100644
--- a/groups/kernel/gmin64/config-lts/linux-intel-lts2025/x86_64_defconfig
+++ b/groups/kernel/gmin64/config-lts/linux-intel-lts2025/x86_64_defconfig
@@ -2075,7 +2075,8 @@ CONFIG_BLK_DEV_RAM_SIZE=8192
 # CONFIG_ATA_OVER_ETH is not set
 CONFIG_VIRTIO_BLK=y
 # CONFIG_BLK_DEV_RBD is not set
-# CONFIG_BLK_DEV_UBLK is not set
+CONFIG_BLK_DEV_UBLK=y
+CONFIG_BLKDEV_UBLK_LEGACY_OPCODES=y
 
 #
 # NVME Support
-- 
2.34.1

